      "text": "[[p0]] [[[p1]]|[[p2]]] [[[p3]]|[[p4]]] [[[p5]]|[[p6]]] [[[p7]]|[[p8]]=MODEL] [[[p9]]=seconds] [[[p10]]|[[p11]]] [[[p12]]] [[[p13]]|[[p14]]=DEBUGLEVEL] [[[p15]]] [[[p16]]=CONFIGFILE] [[[p17]]=name=value] [[[p18]]|[[p19]]=LOGFILEBASE] [[[p20]]] [[[p21]]] [[[p22]]|[[p23]]]",
